      "writtenOn": "2019-07-12T16:29:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is related, but I\u0027m trying to get away from the \"long function combined with #ifdef\" style that\u0027s pervasive in the EC code. It\u0027s really hard to read and hard to test. By separating out into a separate function like this it\u0027s easy to add a unit test for this specific function.",
